    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 90,
        "text": "I found a quotation in three websites. Can I use that as three sources for my essay?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "92a29a1e01912aceac6a8cc94892b48982b9fbdf16129020d88158bdb4799f6a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 98,
        "sourceEnd": 183,
        "text": "First check whether the sites are independent. Do they identify an original document?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "37f69c6e9021e8dda1d8bc4281d74de7a0b121f149cb7f273eb0ad91e18e5f68",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 190,
        "sourceEnd": 285,
        "text": "Two copy the same magazine article. The third links to a council report from the previous year.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0ba8a2bcf3d207ec71760f827be1a84add0f9827d1911762f661f280d43698b4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 293,
        "sourceEnd": 369,
        "text": "Read the report itself. Repetition does not create independent confirmation.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "5113c4d63effae1d0403fd0475636b488ac97d0e36bdddff06c6b345aed7ad6f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 376,
        "sourceEnd": 549,
        "text": "I have now found the sentence on page fourteen. The websites shortened it. The report says the change may reduce delays on one route, not that it will improve all transport.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0aab9af5ebd09f12065dc1a64c5b3ecf54b4c92b1a55574969e0ee8ea5cd7246",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 557,
        "sourceEnd": 622,
        "text": "That missing qualification changes the claim. What will you cite?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "69a72e986fe3a478a7ec198374d4c7617d7b190099208687d5c49df978f76aa2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 629,
        "sourceEnd": 767,
        "text": "The council report, with the page number. I will paraphrase the limited conclusion and keep the original wording in my notes for checking.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9009c35e94687defec965d1c646a3646c6d39dccd09b06620dea9cf3c5b27f1b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 775,
        "sourceEnd": 814,
        "text": "What about the chart you wanted to use?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d56619d82d1e2edaf032eeaef69afeaf190093ced68cb41d2675845741c667ba",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 821,
        "sourceEnd": 957,
        "text": "It compares passenger totals, but the vertical axis starts at ninety thousand. The difference looks much larger than it would from zero.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e4b3296f1bc4b31eb98bac91290e4e7bb2300fa9c31f3701af664bad2f9dd9d1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 965,
        "sourceEnd": 1012,
        "text": "Does that automatically make the numbers false?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "898fc30af4b019d38d15ebaf19fa07df2e52e7470e5e6b30a1a36735326ba3a8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 1019,
        "sourceEnd": 1177,
        "text": "No. The values may be accurate, but the visual emphasis needs explaining. I will state the actual values and avoid treating the picture as a separate finding.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "07b48f5994b3d6be8003d21c00dd24323f989f3fbbcbb4fcbe6111891904583b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1185,
        "sourceEnd": 1309,
        "text": "Good. Send your source notes tomorrow. We will check that each claim remains within the scope of the document supporting it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "fd0c9f3a4c920dbc6bbf1bacd7b4c59c179e38d0c79b9fe6c469137aea1fe53d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
